          <rdf:li>Horde Prime (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/M</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Ex Force Captain Adora</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alt Episode</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>hella angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora Has Issues (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hurt Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra is not having a good time</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow is trying his best</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer is trying</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta Being Entrapta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Horde Prime Being a Jerk (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>no regrets</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora Needs Therapy (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra) Needs a Hug</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora actually confesses</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>what is this a romance novel</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Graphic Depictions Of Violence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Major Character Death</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora is kinda scary in this tbh</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra is on a different level</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Episode: s05e05 Save The Cat</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Post-Episode: s05e05 Save the Cat</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Canon Divergence</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora's absoloute badass fighting style</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Super Renegade Adora</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>It literally just keeps getting worse</rdf:li>
